[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692756478","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103459#issuecomment-2692756478","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103459","id":2692756478,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ggDP-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T14:24:16Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T14:24:16Z","body":"Seems like:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101666\n\nWhich was solved by forbidding embedding in single window mode, unsure what changed after\n\nCC @Hilderin ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692756478/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692812664","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103459#issuecomment-2692812664","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103459","id":2692812664,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ggQ94","user":{"login":"Hilderin","id":81109165,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTA5MTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81109165?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin","html_url":"https://github.com/Hilderin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hilderin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T16:50:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T16:50:03Z","body":"The difference here is that the progress dialog and notifications are not real native windows. The progress dialog was changed in 4.4 to a plain panel to prevent Godot from grabbing focus while importing assets. I think the notifications were never native windows. So these issues are also present in multi-window mode.\n\nUntil the embedding is done using a different technique, I don't think this can be easily fixed. Maybe detecting when the game is running and displaying the progress dialog or notifications differently?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692812664/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https: